+[-]
+## Music
+
+Requires [yt-dlp](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp) on the host's PATH (or set `YTDLP_PATH` in `.env`). ffmpeg is bundled via `ffmpeg-static`.
+
+Commands: `play` (`p`), `pause`, `resume`, `skip` (`s`), `stop`, `queue` (`q`), `nowplaying` (`np`), `loop [off|track|queue]`, `shuffle`, `remove <n>`, `leave` (`l`).
